<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Mu Online AutoRR</Major>
    <Description>Webzen Mu online auto reset script, working on the official mu and private servers

Tested on mu online "Ferea" map and private server. Take 2-3mins for a reset. Can be adjustable to your liking.

Resolution to be used = 1280 x 720 16:9 (Wide) Windowed

Mu helper function is also activated in this script.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download</Comment>
